  "description": "Faro browser telemetry from app.kidays.fr through the public gateway (j9w3fh6s.kidays.fr), sent only by visitors whose current consent cookie (version 3) accepts analytics. Closed projection: route-template page URLs, Web Vitals numbers, error class + route events. No traces, sessions, storage, console, replay or identity. Counts cover consenting visitors only; they are not traffic totals or unique people.",
